        <abstract>
            <para>Original provider:
Kate Stafford, University of Washington

Dataset credits:
Kate Stafford, University of Washington

Abstract:
Passive acoustic data were collected from a mooring deployed at 71.412 N 152.0065 W in the Beaufort Sea. Sounds of bowhead and beluga whales and bearded seals were recorded seasonally. Bowhead and beluga whale sounds occurred in the fall, spring and summer. Bearded seals were recorded primarily in the winter.
</para>
        </abstract>
